              <a href="/service-areas/" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-slate-800 font-bold">
                🚐 Nashville Metro Service Areas
              </a>
              <a href="/about-us/" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-slate-800 font-bold">
                👨‍🔧 Meet Owner Rahim (Master Locksmith)
              </a>
              <a href="/contact-armstrong-locksmith/" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-slate-800 font-bold">
                📞 Contact &amp; Dispatch Hours
              </a>
              <a href="/blog/" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-slate-800 font-bold">
                📰 Guides &amp; Field Case Studies
